  "_doc": "SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for every fish abbreviation, alias and function \u2014 and for the Aliases/Functions sections of fish_greeting. fish.nix generates programs.fish.{shellAbbrs,shellAliases,functions} from this file AND generates the __cloud_commands_help function the greeting calls, so the greeting can never advertise something that isn't installed (or miss something that is). flake.nix derives sharedAliases (bash+zsh) from the entries flagged shared:true. Add a command HERE \u2014 nothing else to edit. Descriptions must not contain double quotes (they are embedded in generated fish echo lines).",
